/T (This report documents the activities and observations recorded in the W2 PM1 and W2 PM5 internship evidence pack. The work comprised local network discovery and external web-infrastructure reconnaissance. The internal discovery exercise identified three responsive hosts on the observed /24 network. The external reconnaissance exercise collected domain-registration information, resolved the target domain to an IPv4 address, fingerprinted publicly exposed web technologies, reviewed HTTP response headers, and identified a web application firewall \(WAF\) signature.)
/E (This report documents the activities and observations recorded in the W2 PM1 and W2 PM5 internship evidence pack. The work comprised local network discovery and external web-infrastructure reconnaissance. The internal discovery exercise identified three responsive hosts on the observed /24 network. The external reconnaissance exercise collected domain-registration information, resolved the target domain to an IPv4 address, fingerprinted publicly exposed web technologies, reviewed HTTP response headers, and identified a web application firewall \(WAF\) signature.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
