/Title (This report documents the activities and observations recorded in the W2 PM1 and W2 PM5 internship evidence pack. The work comprised local network discovery and external web-infrastructure reconnaissance. The internal discovery exercise identified three responsive hosts on the observed /24 network. The external reconnaissance exercise collected domain-registration information, resolved the target domain to an IPv4 address, fingerprinted publicly exposed web technologies, reviewed HTTP response headers, and identified a web application firewall \(WAF\) signature.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 332 0 R
/Next 414 0 R
>>
endobj
382 0 obj
<<
/Title (Overall conclusion: the evidence provides a useful baseline of the observed network and public web stack. Additional, explicitly authorized testing would be required to assess exposed services, application security controls, patch status, access-control weaknesses, and the effectiveness of defensive configurations.)
/Dest [11 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 332 0 R
/Prev 414 0 R
>>
endobj
