/Title (The W2 PM1 and W2 PM5 activities demonstrate practical familiarity with foundational network and web reconnaissance workflows. The internal scan identified three responsive hosts on the observed /24 network, while external reconnaissance collected domain-registration details, resolved the domain to 192.232.216.135, fingerprinted a WordPress/Apache-based web presence, reviewed HTTP headers, and identified a ModSecurity WAF signature.)
/Dest [14 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 333 0 R
/Next 386 0 R
>>
